  "download_disabled": false,
  "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\">This dataset represents a first attempt to freely share georeferenced North African irrigation methods, polygons of land use/cover, with georeferenced photos across Moroccan agricultural regions over two agricultural seasons (December 2023 to January 2025), For data quality assessment, ndvi time series were included for each plot to show the consistency of categories with the ndvi intervals.</p><p dir=\"ltr\">The files contains :</p><ul><li>Shapefile_Crop and irrigation data</li><li>Georeferenced photos_Crop and irrigation data</li><li>Sentinel2 bands and Ndvi for surveyed parcels </li></ul><p><br></p>",
